# guards_demo

cast WREN
  .label "Wren"

-- start

~ var $trust := 30

WREN
  What do you want to know?

  * The town's history.
    WREN
      Founded by herring boats. Long story.
  * The bell's secret. if $trust > 50
    WREN
      Not yet.
  + Nothing more.
    -> ending

-- earn_trust

~ $trust := 75

WREN
  All right. Ask again.

-> start

-- ending

WREN
  Safe travels.
